Using Menu Bar Gate while doing paid work or operating a business is allowed. A company may use it internally, and it does not matter if using the Software indirectly helps that company make money.

The restriction is on making money **from Menu Bar Gate itself, its code, or a derivative product**, not on making money while using it.

If you want to build, distribute, or sell a commercial product based on Menu Bar Gate or its code, you must first obtain permission from the Copyright Holder and, where applicable, agree to separate commercial terms.

The terms below are the legally operative terms of this License.

